r a date, Elaine stumbles upon a key to the records room.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xAW0UdadNOZ2GZ5e96zrlKOPFHK.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIzL1RoZS1Db25zdWx0YW50LSUyODIwMjMtJTI5Lw.1.4","title":"Sang","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2023-02-23T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"We flashback to Sang-woo meeting Regus Patoff and their binding contract. In the present, Craig’s still rattled by his night out with the boss, while Elaine makes strides to keep CompWare afloat.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lSdZnEt7rKpYuTrCvHwsqZjL0iw.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIzL1RoZS1Db25zdWx0YW50LSUyODIwMjMtJTI5Lw.1.5","title":"Sick","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2023-02-23T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Determined to uncover the enigmatic Frank Florez, Craig makes a trip to Pomona. At the office, chaos ensues when Regus Patoff announces a managerial suite is up for grabs.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/z6SIS8jmF6AQYAdnrB5MAgWuSra.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIzL1RoZS1Db25zdWx0YW50LSUyODIwMjMtJTI5Lw.1.6","title":"Glass","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2023-02-23T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"As CompWare’s latest game nears launch, Elaine fears the worst of its effect on consumers. Despite Craig’s efforts at church, Patti feels Regus Patoff’s pull, drawing her from her fiancé.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/af1U89hh7ruAtiJ4bc7k8opPGcy.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIzL1RoZS1Db25zdWx0YW50LSUyODIwMjMtJTI5Lw.1.7","title":"Elephant","season":1,"episode":7,"released":"2023-02-23T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Days later, Patti’s yet to return home, causing Craig to spiral. Chained to an impossible task, Elaine finds herself calling upon an ex for help.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3SFw629HshnLxAMidaVbAbMr7XV.j